# Summary: Backend-agnostic drag and drop core for vtui.
#
# Nothing here talks to a display server: this is the contract every
# graphical backend will implement (X11 XDND first), plus the payload
# types and the text/uri-list codec every one of them needs.
#
# Plan:
#   1. dragdrop.go: DropAction / DragPhase / DragPayload / DragEvent,
#      DropTarget and DragBackend registration, DeliverDragEvent with a
#      hop to the UI thread and a timeout, uri-list helpers.
#   2. dragdrop_test.go: uri-list round trip, action arithmetic,
#      inline delivery, backend registration.
#   3. DRAGDROP.md: the contract a backend has to satisfy.

